  "details": "I want you to be able to implement a Password Lock for avatars in the system, thereby providing 100% protection. This function will be useful in the Vrchat game so that you can create passwords for avatars. Thus, authors will be able to close access to an avatar with a password. The same NSFW will not be so dangerous if the authors use this system. I see a lot of NSFW avatars in the world of avatar searches, and then you will not need a private system to close avatars. Yes, he will see and copy the avatar, but access to the avatar functions will be unavailable and the avatar will not move until the person enters the password for access to the avatar that he received from the author. The function is very useful.\n\nI'm just tired of protecting my avatars with a password from a script by GabSith who created this wonderful script but there was no update. Please implement this script for creating a password for avatars in the game. You can find out about the author by GabSith. He just provides a free script and its functions that I described.",
